{
    "title": "km3pipe: An analysis framework for KM3NeT",
    "description": "<p>km3pipe is an analysis framework for the KM3NeT neutrino telescopes. It provides a pipeline of pumps, modules and sinks to process data, native Python access to the KM3NeT file formats, network protocols and databases, and a set of command line tools built on top of it.</p>",
